# `slice` out of range on a `str`. The behaviour existed; the sentence licensing
# it landed with panel 027 R5, and panel 025 R2 held it back until it could be
# verified on BOTH operand types — which is this case and the next one.
# Bulk regression case.

function main()
    s = "abcde"
    print(slice(s, from: 1, to: 3))
    print(slice(s, from: 1, to: 9))
